---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/layout/SiteHeader.astro';
---

<Layout title="About | Premium Web Agency">
  <SiteHeader slot="header" />
  
  <div class="flex flex-col min-h-screen pt-32 pb-24 px-4 md:px-8">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight mb-6">About the Agency</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-muted-foreground mb-12 leading-relaxed">
        We are an independent web engineering and design firm based in Indonesia, partnering with ambitious companies worldwide.
      </p>
      
      <div class="space-y-12">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium mb-4">Our Philosophy</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            We believe that the best digital products sit at the intersection of rigorous technical engineering and premium, restrained design. We do not chase trends or rely on heavy, unnecessary client-side frameworks when a simpler, more robust architecture will serve the business better.
          </p>
        </section>
        
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium mb-4">Technical Precision</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Every project we ship is held to the highest standards of accessibility, performance, and maintainability. We build systems that internal teams can actually scale, utilizing technologies like Astro for static perfection and React for targeted interactivity.
          </p>
        </section>
        
        <section class="border-t border-border pt-8 mt-16">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium mb-4">Ready to start?</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-6">
            We take on a limited number of projects per quarter to ensure execution quality.
          </p>
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-foreground px-8 text-base font-medium text-background shadow transition-transform active:scale-95 hover:bg-foreground/90">
            Discuss Your Project
          </a>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
